01:07:11,799 --> 01:07:13,966
to continue to wear protection
because you're, what,

1313
01:07:13,968 --> 01:07:15,701
20 years older than he is?

1314
01:07:15,703 --> 01:07:18,638
And all those nubile
young things on the beach

1315
01:07:18,640 --> 01:07:22,140
just happened to be
you 20 years ago.

1316
01:07:22,142 --> 01:07:24,644
Just thinking of
your protection.

1317
01:07:24,646 --> 01:07:25,312
Chin chin.

1318
01:07:47,802 --> 01:07:50,302
Hello, Detective.

1319
01:07:50,304 --> 01:07:51,871
How long will he be gone?

1320
01:07:51,873 --> 01:07:54,006
Two days.

1321
01:07:54,008 --> 01:07:57,843
Nora, let's
just get out of here.

1322
01:07:57,845 --> 01:07:59,344
And do what?

1323
01:07:59,346 --> 01:08:00,746
I'm about
a step and a half

1324
01:08:00,748 --> 01:08:03,783
away from finding that
recording, and I will get it.

1325
01:08:03,785 --> 01:08:05,350
And if Jack Wolfe
shows up dead, I

1326
01:08:05,352 --> 01:08:07,587
will have no choice
but to arrest you.

1327
01:08:07,589 --> 01:08:08,486
Will you?

1328
01:08:08,488 --> 01:08:09,454
Believe it.

1329
01:08:09,456 --> 01:08:10,990
Just call her off, Nora.

1330
01:08:10,992 --> 01:08:12,324
Why?

1331
01:08:12,326 --> 01:08:14,492
Because the last thing on
Earth I want is to arrest you.

1332
01:08:14,494 --> 01:08:15,962
Really?

1333
01:08:15,964 --> 01:08:18,196
And what do you
want to do with me?

1334
01:08:18,198 --> 01:08:21,801
You want to take me away, and
we live happily ever after?

1335
01:08:21,803 --> 01:08:23,703
Yeah.

1336
01:08:23,705 --> 01:08:25,037
Dani, you're such a fool.

1337
01:08:25,039 --> 01:08:25,871
We could have everything.

1338
01:08:25,873 --> 01:08:26,973
All I want is you.

1339
01:08:26,975 --> 01:08:32,912
Then I tell you what.

1340
01:08:32,914 --> 01:08:36,414
When Jack turns up dead, you
forget about the recording

1341
01:08:36,416 --> 01:08:38,050
and arrest Chad.

1342
01:08:38,052 --> 01:08:42,788
Then you can have
me and the money.

1343
01:08:42,790 --> 01:08:45,725
Jealous man can
always be used for something.

1344
01:08:45,727 --> 01:08:46,424
Is that right?

1345
01:08:46,426 --> 01:08:47,560
Ugh.

1346
01:08:47,562 --> 01:08:48,761
You're the one I wanted.

1347
01:08:48,763 --> 01:08:51,463
You're the one
I've always wanted.

1348
01:08:51,465 --> 01:08:55,133
If you want to stop it, shoot
me, arrest me, shoot Jack.

1349
01:08:55,135 --> 01:08:57,103
But just do something.

1350
01:08:57,105 --> 01:08:59,505
Because if you
don't, I'm trapped.

1351
01:08:59,507 --> 01:09:01,974
I don't have a choice.

1352
01:09:19,393 --> 01:09:21,961
All right, good.

1353
01:09:21,963 --> 01:09:23,696
You're sulking.

1354
01:09:23,698 --> 01:09:25,430
Sulking makes you
look suspicious.

1355
01:09:25,432 --> 01:09:27,033
Come on, perk up.

1356
01:09:27,035 --> 01:09:29,334
Give me that, the
girls love me, face.

1357
01:09:29,336 --> 01:09:31,169
Come on.

1358
01:09:31,171 --> 01:09:34,172
Yes.

1359
01:09:34,174 --> 01:09:36,207
Perfecto!

1360
01:09:36,209 --> 01:09:37,409
You handsome devil.

1361
01:09:40,114 --> 01:09:42,247
Why are you sulking?

1362
01:09:42,249 --> 01:09:44,116
Oh, man, I think
she was with that guy

1363
01:09:44,118 --> 01:09:46,217
again the other day
when you were in Miami.

1364
01:09:46,219 --> 01:09:48,621
You know, the gardener saw
them go into your place.

1365
01:09:48,623 --> 01:09:49,487
What guy?

1366
01:09:49,489 --> 01:09:51,389
Well, the
cop who hit me, man.

1367
01:09:51,391 --> 01:09:52,058
No!

1368
01:09:52,060 --> 01:09:52,892
Yeah!

1369
01:09:52,894 --> 01:09:54,160
Shocking!

1370
01:09:54,162 --> 01:09:55,795
Well, what do you think?

1371
01:09:55,797 --> 01:09:56,327
Well--

1372
01:09:56,329 --> 01:09:57,195
Uh-uh.

1373
01:09:57,197 --> 01:09:59,031
Are you jealous
that she's playing

1374
01:09:59,033 --> 01:10:01,767
hanky panky behind your back?

1375
01:10:01,769 --> 01:10:02,500
No, dude.

1376
01:10:02,502 --> 01:10:03,135
No.

1377
01:10:03,137 --> 01:10:04,704
See, it's with the cop.

1378
01:10:04,706 --> 01:10:08,406
I mean, what if she says, you
know, if Jack winds up dead,

1379
01:10:08,408 --> 01:10:11,143
you bust Chad, and then
she and him go and boogie

1380
01:10:11,145 --> 01:10:13,278
down to the Bahamas, man?

1381
01:10:13,280 --> 01:10:16,115
That's outstanding, Chad!

1382
01:10:16,117 --> 01:10:18,918
Excellent, my boy!

1383
01:10:18,920 --> 01:10:21,887
You see, you've only been my
adopted son for a short time,

1384
01:10:21,889 --> 01:10:23,956
and already your IQ is up.

1385
01:10:23,958 --> 01:10:25,256
Thank you, man.

1386
01:10:25,258 --> 01:10:29,161
But allow me to posit
another idea that could perhaps

1387
01:10:29,163 --> 01:10:34,200
be even more problematic.

1388
01:10:34,202 --> 01:10:37,636
What's more problematic
than getting arrested, dude?

1389
01:10:37,638 --> 01:10:41,507
Oh, what if Nora
decides to dump you,

1390
01:10:41,509 --> 01:10:45,343
and then she remembers that
Chad is the only person who

1391
01:10:45,345 --> 01:10:47,079
knows I'm guilty of murder?

1392
01:10:47,081 --> 01:10:49,548
Therefore, she says
to herself, Chad's

1393
01:10:49,550 --> 01:10:51,517
the only person who
can put me in prison

1394
01:10:51,519 --> 01:10:53,119
for the rest of my life.

1395
01:10:53,121 --> 01:11:01,392
Then she says, I've got to--

1396
01:11:01,394 --> 01:11:03,696
I gotta kill Chad.

1397
01:11:03,698 --> 01:11:08,268
Positively, Jean, my son.

1398
01:11:12,372 --> 01:11:18,577
Lovey, I don't know if our Chad
has confided this to you or not,

1399
01:11:18,579 --> 01:11:22,548
but I suggested to
him the other day

1400
01:11:22,550 --> 01:11:25,918
that after he and I fake
my death, that both of us

1401
01:11:25,920 --> 01:11:28,319
should kill you.

1402
01:11:28,321 --> 01:11:30,055
Then Jean gets the money.

1403
01:11:30,057 --> 01:11:34,560
And naturally, he shares
it with dear old papa.

1404
01:11:34,562 --> 01:11:37,196
I think he's taken quite
a shine to the idea.

1405
01:11:37,198 --> 01:11:41,000
You know, he doesn't trust
you anymore, querida.

1406
01:11:41,002 --> 01:11:44,870
Quite frankly,
he's afraid of you.

1407
01:11:44,872 --> 01:11:45,470
Is he?

1408
01:11:45,472 --> 01:11:47,039
Mm-hmm.

1409
01:11:47,041 --> 01:11:50,578
But you know I never hide
anything from you, mi amor.

1410
01:11:55,583 --> 01:11:58,951
I know you think I'm
a liar, duplicitous.

1411
01:11:58,953 --> 01:12:04,957
But I think I am the most
constant of life's companions.

1412
01:12:04,959 --> 01:12:08,828
I say we stick to
the original plan.

1413
01:12:08,830 --> 01:12:11,297
Pin my murder on
Chad, split the money,

1414
01:12:11,299 --> 01:12:16,334
and I give you the
ultimate gift of love.

1415
01:12:16,336 --> 01:12:18,704
I set you free.

1416
01:12:18,706 --> 01:12:22,675
I swear to God, Nora.

1417
01:12:22,677 --> 01:12:25,311
I love you.

1418
01:12:25,313 --> 01:12:27,179
I do.

1419
01:12:27,181 --> 01:12:32,518
I know you think I'm
lying, but I do love you.

1420
01:12:32,520 --> 01:12:35,453
Siempre, amore mio.

1421
01:12:35,455 --> 01:12:39,725
I love you because you and
I are exactly the same.

1422
01:12:39,727 --> 01:12:44,029
The world judges us harshly,
but I don't judge you at all.

1423
01:12:44,031 --> 01:12:49,201
Even when I know you and lover
boy are planning to kill me,

1424
01:12:49,203 --> 01:12:51,339
I know and I don't judge you.

1425
01:12:53,841 --> 01:12:56,175
God, I hate this.

1426
01:12:56,844 --> 01:12:58,376
Oh, no, no, no, no.

1427
01:12:58,378 --> 01:12:59,879
Shh.

1428
01:12:59,881 --> 01:13:00,946
Hush, little kitten.

1429
01:13:00,948 --> 01:13:02,413
No.

1430
01:13:02,415 --> 01:13:05,551
It's all right.

1431
01:13:05,553 --> 01:13:08,654
So tell me.

1432
01:13:08,656 --> 01:13:14,593
Even when I know you're going
to kill me, what should I do?

1433
01:13:14,595 --> 01:13:15,495
Hmm?

1434
01:13:17,698 --> 01:13:22,668
In my place, Nora,
what would you do?

1435
01:13:22,670 --> 01:13:24,169
Kill me.

1436
01:13:24,171 --> 01:13:26,305
Hmm.

1437
01:13:26,307 --> 01:13:28,507
See?

1438
01:13:28,509 --> 01:13:30,309
I never lie to you.

1439
01:13:30,311 --> 01:13:33,345
No, you never lie.

1440
01:13:33,347 --> 01:13:36,348
All right.

1441
01:13:36,350 --> 01:13:39,251
So let's plan my death.

1442
01:13:41,889 --> 01:13:44,123
Put this in the engine
room, and hurry.

1443
01:13:44,125 --> 01:13:45,824
You've got 15 minutes.

1444
01:13:45,826 --> 01:13:49,094
Jean, I'm proud of you, son.

1445
01:14:22,863 --> 01:14:24,763
Jack?

1446
01:14:24,765 --> 01:14:25,264
Jack?

1447
01:14:32,139 --> 01:14:36,241
Promise me that
you'll consider this, Nora.

1448
01:14:36,243 --> 01:14:42,550
'Cause if not, then I'll have no
choice but to help him kill you.

1449
01:14:46,620 --> 01:14:49,922
No more games.

1450
01:14:49,924 --> 01:14:51,623
No more games.

1451
01:14:52,760 --> 01:14:56,362
This works on the
parasympathetic nervous system.

1452
01:14:56,364 --> 01:14:58,964
It's called pilocarpine.

1453
01:14:58,966 --> 01:15:00,966
I've had some
experience with it.

1454
01:15:00,968 --> 01:15:03,102
But she won't feel a thing.

1455
01:15:03,104 --> 01:15:05,504
Her throat will constrict.

1456
01:15:05,506 --> 01:15:06,739
She'll choke a bit.

1457
01:15:06,741 --> 01:15:09,008
And there'll be some
gasping for air.

1458
01:15:09,010 --> 01:15:11,810
It's called paraldehyde.

1459
01:15:11,812 --> 01:15:16,281
Toxicity level 5,
reaction time immediate.

1460
01:15:16,283 --> 01:15:20,185
His heart spasms, head feels
like it's about to explode.

1461
01:15:21,655 --> 01:15:23,956
There will be bronchial
constriction, wheezing.

1462
01:15:23,958 --> 01:15:25,124
The muscles will twitch.

1463
01:15:25,126 --> 01:15:26,258
The pulse will slow.

1464
01:15:26,260 --> 01:15:28,127
And convulsions will ensue.

1465
01:15:28,129 --> 01:15:32,798
You hit him with it in
the shoulder or in the back,

1466
01:15:32,800 --> 01:15:34,366
wherever.

1467
01:15:38,973 --> 01:15:44,676
Et voila, death by
asphyxia and cardiac arrest.

1468
01:15:44,678 --> 01:15:48,213
One shot, et voila.

1469
01:15:48,215 --> 01:15:49,782
It's over.

1470
01:15:49,784 --> 01:15:53,719
Well, you see, Lovey,
I attach the yellow wire here,

1471
01:15:53,721 --> 01:15:59,491
like so, and the
blue one into here.

1472
01:15:59,493 --> 01:16:03,262
In this scenario, I tell Chad--

1473
01:16:03,264 --> 01:16:04,630
Bomb in the engine room.

1474
01:16:04,632 --> 01:16:05,664
I'll be waiting for you.

1475
01:16:05,666 --> 01:16:06,465
All right?

1476
01:16:06,467 --> 01:16:07,132
Come on.

1477
01:16:07,134 --> 01:16:07,866
Get it done.

1478
01:16:07,868 --> 01:16:09,001
We can get the hell out of here.

1479
01:16:09,003 --> 01:16:10,302
Awesome, man.

1480
01:16:15,309 --> 01:16:16,341
You're done?

1481
01:16:16,343 --> 01:16:17,342
All set, man.

1482
01:16:21,882 --> 01:16:24,683
He trusts me implicitly.

1483
01:16:24,685 --> 01:16:30,889
Such a lovely boy,
but thick as a brick.

1484
01:16:36,363 --> 01:16:38,664
Yes, got it.

1485
01:16:38,666 --> 01:16:39,832
His name's Perez.

1486
01:16:39,834 --> 01:16:40,432
Who?

1487
01:16:40,434 --> 01:16:44,269
Jack's flunky.

1488
01:16:44,271 --> 01:16:46,573
He's too cheap to pay anybody
anything without getting

1489
01:16:46,575 --> 01:16:49,542
a tax write off for it.

1490
01:16:49,544 --> 01:16:52,211
See here?

1491
01:16:52,213 --> 01:16:54,246
He listed someone
named Anibal Perez

1492
01:16:54,248 --> 01:16:57,182
as a gardener for his business.

1493
01:16:57,184 --> 01:16:59,284
Here's the same
Anibal Perez listed

1494
01:16:59,286 --> 01:17:01,887
as a handyman two years later.

1495
01:17:01,889 --> 01:17:06,792
And here is the same
Perez listed as a janitor.

1496
01:17:06,794 --> 01:17:09,596
Now all we need is an address.

1497
01:17:09,598 --> 01:17:13,699
Then we get the voice
recorder and kill Jack.

1498
01:17:13,701 --> 01:17:15,801
The
guy's name is Perez.

1499
01:17:15,803 --> 01:17:17,169
Anibal Perez.

1500
01:17:17,171 --> 01:17:18,837
You got an
address for us?

1501
01:17:18,839 --> 01:17:20,139
No, no.

1502
01:17:20,141 --> 01:17:21,740
I don't know no address.

1503
01:17:41,262 --> 01:17:43,362
Jack tampered with it.

1504
01:17:43,364 --> 01:17:46,331
He'll tell you to set
the timer for 15 minutes

1505
01:17:46,333 --> 01:17:48,100
while he waits in the dinghy.

1506
01:17:48,102 --> 01:17:51,203
But it'll explode
after 3 minutes.

1507
01:17:51,205 --> 01:17:55,741
So once you get him on the boat,
hit him with the paraldehyde.

1508
01:18:00,748 --> 01:18:06,084
And then use this.

1509
01:18:06,086 --> 01:18:09,589
Put both bombs on the boat,
but only trigger this one.

1510
01:18:09,591 --> 01:18:12,625
Set it for 10 minutes, which
will leave you plenty of time

1511
01:18:12,627 --> 01:18:13,725
to get out of there.

1512
01:18:18,832 --> 01:18:20,966
The biggest mistake
my husband ever made

1513
01:18:20,968 --> 01:18:26,004
was showing me how
to build a bomb.

1514
01:19:22,997 --> 01:19:26,164
That'll be Jack, Mr. Perez.

1515
01:19:26,166 --> 01:19:29,501
Now, give me the voice recorder
and the videos, or you're dead.

1516
01:19:29,503 --> 01:19:32,004
What recorder?

1517
01:19:32,006 --> 01:19:33,005
Mira.

1518
01:19:33,007 --> 01:19:34,741
I don't know nothing.

1519
01:19:34,743 --> 01:19:36,308
I'll count to three.

1520
01:19:36,310 --> 01:19:39,077
And either what I want
is on its way to my hand,

1521
01:19:39,079 --> 01:19:42,615
or your brains are on
their way to that wall.

1522
01:19:42,617 --> 01:19:44,249
Please, Señora.

1523
01:19:44,251 --> 01:19:44,783
What recorder?

1524
01:19:44,785 --> 01:19:46,351
1, 2--

1525
01:19:46,353 --> 01:19:47,419
Drop it, Nora.

1526
01:19:50,991 --> 01:19:51,959
It's over.

1527
01:19:54,428 --> 01:19:56,995
You'd kill me, Dani?

1528
01:19:56,997 --> 01:19:57,829
Is that true?

1529
01:19:57,831 --> 01:20:00,165
You'd kill me?

1530
01:20:03,137 --> 01:20:05,871
He wouldn't have to.

1531
01:20:05,873 --> 01:20:06,840
I would.

1532
01:20:11,746 --> 01:20:14,379
Dr. Castro,
the remains of Chad Sellers

1533
01:20:14,381 --> 01:20:17,382
were found and shipped by our
department to your laboratory

1534
01:20:17,384 --> 01:20:18,850
for DNA testing.

1535
01:20:18,852 --> 01:20:21,721
They included the fibia and
tibia bone, respectively.

1536
01:20:21,723 --> 01:20:23,922
They were then matched
against hair samples found

1537
01:20:23,924 --> 01:20:26,058
in Mr. Sellers' apartment.

1538
01:20:26,060 --> 01:20:29,227
And your conclusion
was what, Dr. Castro?

1539
01:20:29,229 --> 01:20:30,996
The DNA
match between the bones

1540
01:20:30,998 --> 01:20:33,865
pulled out of the water and
the hair sample was positive.

1541
01:20:33,867 --> 01:20:35,802
I have not the slightest
doubt that those were

1542
01:20:35,804 --> 01:20:37,269
the remains of Mr. Sellers.

1543
01:20:37,271 --> 01:20:39,505
Likewise,
there was a blood splatter

1544
01:20:39,507 --> 01:20:42,341
on a piece of decking which
was ultimately recovered,

1545
01:20:42,343 --> 01:20:44,142
and one tooth, which
was also shipped

1546
01:20:44,144 --> 01:20:46,011
to your department for testing.

1547
01:20:46,013 --> 01:20:47,846
What were the results
of those tests?

1548
01:20:47,848 --> 01:20:50,248
The blood splatters
and the tooth in question,

1549
01:20:50,250 --> 01:20:52,851
which, by the way, feature
a very distinctive cap that

1550
01:20:52,853 --> 01:20:57,590
would only have been available
in Cuba between 1945 and 1958,

1551
01:20:57,592 --> 01:21:00,626
were positively matched with
known DNA samples of Mr. Jack

1552
01:21:00,628 --> 01:21:01,627
Wolfe.

1553
01:21:11,171 --> 01:21:13,740
Lieutenant
Fuentes, the head

1554
01:21:13,742 --> 01:21:16,341
of the bomb squad for the
San Miguel State Police

1555
01:21:16,343 --> 01:21:17,844
for the area of Puerto Seguro.

1556
01:21:17,846 --> 01:21:19,211
Is that all correct?

1557
01:21:19,213 --> 01:21:20,445
Yes, sir.

1558
01:21:20,447 --> 01:21:21,848
Were you able
to determine the cause

1559
01:21:21,850 --> 01:21:24,751
of the explosion which occurred
on the motor yacht Circe

1560
01:21:24,753 --> 01:21:26,552
on the morning of the 15th?

1561
01:21:26,554 --> 01:21:29,154
Well, there
were two explosions, actually,

1562
01:21:29,156 --> 01:21:30,989
two separate bombs.

1563
01:21:30,991 --> 01:21:32,592
The triggering
device, however, seems

1564
01:21:32,594 --> 01:21:35,795
to have come from a bomb
planted in the engine room.

1565
01:21:35,797 --> 01:21:38,664
The marina surveillance caught
the whole thing on tape,

1566
01:21:38,666 --> 01:21:41,667
and we were able to recover
part of the bomb's timing device

1567
01:21:41,669 --> 01:21:43,435
from the ocean floor.

1568
01:21:51,746 --> 01:21:53,780
Detective, I'm going

